1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:01,582
What if your heart

2
00:00:01,582 --> 00:00:03,138
suddenly beat five times

3
00:00:03,138 --> 00:00:03,636
faster?

4
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:05,299
At rest, it beats

5
00:00:05,299 --> 00:00:06,641
about seventy times a

6
00:00:06,641 --> 00:00:08,106
minute. Five times that

7
00:00:08,106 --> 00:00:09,571
is three hundred fifty.

8
00:00:10,300 --> 00:00:11,489
Speeding up is normal.

9
00:00:11,489 --> 00:00:12,677
Hard exercise can push

10
00:00:12,677 --> 00:00:13,918
a healthy young adult's

11
00:00:13,918 --> 00:00:14,951
heart to around one

12
00:00:14,951 --> 00:00:16,243
hundred ninety beats per

13
00:00:16,243 --> 00:00:16,657
minute.

14
00:00:17,300 --> 00:00:18,497
But at three hundred

15
00:00:18,497 --> 00:00:19,808
fifty, each beat lasts

16
00:00:19,808 --> 00:00:21,062
under two-tenths of a

17
00:00:21,062 --> 00:00:22,658
second. The chambers barely

18
00:00:22,658 --> 00:00:23,798
have time to refill

19
00:00:23,798 --> 00:00:24,653
between beats.

20
00:00:25,300 --> 00:00:26,828
Faster doesn't mean more

21
00:00:26,828 --> 00:00:28,418
blood. With less filling,

22
00:00:28,418 --> 00:00:29,702
each beat pushes out

23
00:00:29,702 --> 00:00:31,230
less, and blood pressure

24
00:00:31,230 --> 00:00:31,658
drops.

25
00:00:32,400 --> 00:00:34,039
Your brain notices first.

26
00:00:34,039 --> 00:00:35,931
Dizziness, tunnel vision, and

27
00:00:35,931 --> 00:00:37,759
fainting could follow within

28
00:00:37,759 --> 00:00:38,326
seconds.

29
00:00:39,300 --> 00:00:40,805
Worse: the heart feeds

30
00:00:40,805 --> 00:00:42,571
itself while relaxing. Now

31
00:00:42,571 --> 00:00:43,880
it barely does, and

32
00:00:43,880 --> 00:00:45,450
its rhythm can collapse

33
00:00:45,450 --> 00:00:46,235
into chaos.

34
00:00:47,400 --> 00:00:48,915
A hummingbird's heart can

35
00:00:48,915 --> 00:00:50,256
top one thousand beats

36
00:00:50,256 --> 00:00:51,363
a minute, but it's

37
00:00:51,363 --> 00:00:52,529
built for it. Yours

38
00:00:52,529 --> 00:00:52,937
isn't.

39
00:00:55,200 --> 00:00:56,688
Your heart doesn't just

40
00:00:56,688 --> 00:00:57,991
beat. It keeps time.

41
00:00:57,991 --> 00:00:59,603
Follow for more what-ifs.
